%N A402162 Number of tilings of an n X n square by isosceles right triangles, each formed by joining some of the 4*n^2 elementary triangles obtained by drawing both diagonals of every unit square in the grid.
%e A402162 a(1) = 7: the unit square can be cut by one diagonal (2 ways), by both diagonals (1 way), or by one diagonal and half of the other (4 ways):
